#: d7b3b52a5d4247488dcaff12c20a5c07 ebad0bf0af414a27904bd6f9e8b03dff
msgid "FrSky Telemetry / SERIAL4"
msgstr "FrSky 数传 / SERIAL4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixracer-overview.rst:223
#: 3f7a5fe7f37e4f35b123ae35e7333acf 5c69f1c3e29c42c5a2c3fa943435b8ac
#: 699c2b084f984892875d5288b88b22d2 ac1876fc708f4b4cb5ee0ee46e836ad5
#: bd48b34290ad47369414ddde7ea9a5cd e1933dff1a174324bbd53f0d51c7f71c
msgid ""
"This port has built in inverters on the TX and RX lines and shunt resistors "
"which allow them to be tied together and connected to an FrSky receiver's "
"SPort input for telemetry. It is on by default, and only "
":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` needs to be set to \"10\" for "
"FrSky passthrough telemetry to be sent to the receiver. See :ref:`common-"
"frsky-telemetry` for more information."
msgstr ""
"此端口在 TX 和 RX 线路上内置反相器和并联电阻，允许将它们连接在一起并接到 FrSky 接收机的 SPort 输入进行数传。默认启用，只需将 "
":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` 设置为「10」即可将 FrSky "
"透传数传发送到接收机。更多信息请参阅 :ref:`common-frsky-telemetry`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixracer-overview.rst:225
#: 7f961a2e13da472aa1118b10cf142735 a431e8f01c944d61a72489eaff8fe420
#: af781028a037474a8fd47a103e8fb5c8 d0c79ddf9c8747b7b162cb321b887a6c
#: d9bb9a549b524d4d919cf2725bee0f49 fa5b5fc4195b4466a39fd859bef38374
msgid ""
"The operation of the TX/RX path inverter can be disabled by setting the "
":ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` parameter to \"2\" to \"invert\" the"
" TX , which will turn off the inversion for both the TX and RX pins. This "
"will allow normal UART operation, if desired."
msgstr ""
"可通过将 :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 参数设置为「2」来「反转」TX，从而禁用 TX/RX "
"路径反相器，这将同时关闭 TX 和 RX 引脚的反转。如果需要，这将允许正常 UART 操作。"

